## 🔍 Key Findings

The analysis shows total sales of approximately **31,933.24**, with total profit of approximately **5,839.45** and total quantity of **58**. Technology generated the highest sales among the categories, followed by Furniture and Office Supplies. Among the regions, Oceania was the strongest contributor to sales, while East recorded the lowest sales. Overall, Technology and Oceania were the strongest contributors to sales in this dataset.

